---
import CopyButton from './CopyButton.vue';
import { configJson } from '../lib/config-example';
---

<section class="section" id="config" aria-labelledby="config-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="config-title">Zero config, fully configurable</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">
      All fields have safe defaults, so Brooom works inside a repository without any config, and
      <code>br sweep ~/code</code> covers every repository below a folder. Tune the rest in
      <code>~/.brooom/config.json</code>. This excerpt makes <code>br sweep</code> run the
      after-agents preset, raises the minimum age to 30 days, turns one detector off and prints the
      summary format by default.
    </p>
    <div data-slot="config-copy" class="code-block">
      <div class="toolbar">
        <CopyButton client:idle text={configJson} label="Copy config example" />
      </div>
      <pre tabindex="0"><code>{configJson}</code></pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .toolbar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }
</style>
